    "handlingStrategy": "COMMIT_OUTCOME_UNKNOWN_STATE_AND_RECONCILIATION",
    "workflow": [
      "1. On distributed timeout or connection reset during D0 commit, client/gateway marks state as COMMIT_OUTCOME_UNKNOWN.",
      "2. Client/Worker MUST NOT immediately issue a new business mutation or blind payment call.",
      "3. Reconciliation query checks D0 Journal and payment provider status using original operationId/idempotencyKey.",
